{
  "name": "canonical",
  "description": "Default canonical titling \u2014 brand-neutral 9-slot / 3-phase architecture (hook \u2192 proof \u2192 close). Vertical uses the full height of the frame: upper editorial for hook/proof, lower conversion close for productName + delivery + CTA. Feed/square keep a bottom-anchored conversion stack; square is feed single-lined for the 1:1 canvas. Landscape is a left-column stack with delivery + visible CTA. Times authored for the nominal 8s clip (timing.js compresses to shorter plates). CTA visible on every format. Scrim none everywhere. Camera-beat alignment (Fable direction 2026-08-04): the canonical Omni prompt shoots pan 0-2.67, logo zoom 2.67-5.12, full-product reveal 5.12-8 (buildVeoPrompt scene marks dur/3, 0.64*dur). Text phases cut ON the camera cuts (2.7/5.1) so transitions feel intentional and the close (productName+CTA) rides the reveal shot.",
